---
// Fold 5. The one full-bleed surface on the page: the consulting ask,
// with a client quote beside it as the attribution for that ask.
//
// This replaces Testimonials.astro. The quote and the name below are
// that component's, carried across verbatim rather than reinvented --
// the sentence is trimmed to the clause the mock quotes, but not a word
// of it is new. Jessica Lillquist is a real client; do not paraphrase
// her or swap in a generic title.
//
// Static by design, and staying that way: this quote was a Swiper
// carousel once, which is a control with nothing to control when there
// is one slide. Do not reintroduce one.
---
<section class="band-press anim-fade-up" aria-labelledby="band-ask">
  <div class="band-press__inner">
    <h2 id="band-ask" class="band-press__ask">
      Most orgs do not need more Salesforce. They need <em>less of the wrong Salesforce.</em>
    </h2>

    <figure class="band-press__quote">
      <blockquote>
        <p>Their expertise, dedication, collaboration, and innovative solutions have consistently exceeded our expectations.</p>
      </blockquote>
      <figcaption class="band-press__cite">Jessica Lillquist, Minlopro Partners</figcaption>
      <a class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm" href="/contact/">Book an org review &rarr;</a>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>
